          "description": "Take a deep breath and press play.\n\nMello is a cozy collection of calming adventures inspired by the curious questions kids ask—like “How are raindrops formed?” or “What is it like inside a volcano when it erupts?”\n\nEach mindful story helps you explore big feelings, wild thoughts, and quiet moments—one peaceful breath at a time.\nPerfect for rest time, bedtime, or anytime you need a little calm.\n",
